        "text_RHYmUy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Digital printing services print images directly onto materials, allowing one to easily go from a PDF file to a printing press with less expense than traditional printing methods, which require special plates and inks. New technological advancements have greatly improved digital printing solutions, resulting in wider use across many industries. Specifically, image resolution and color accuracy improvements have made digital printing a practical alternative to other printing options, such as screen printing, flexographic printing, or offset printing.</p>",
