          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Cutting-Edge Technology",
            "content": "<p>Utilizing the latest digital print technology, we can meet a wide range of digital printing needs. We offer things like digital white ink to provide superior backing coverage for graphics on clear labels, eliminating registration issues because we no longer print these labels with ink and flexo plates.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
