          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Real-Time Marketing",
            "content": "<p>Our digital printing customizations enhance flexibility, letting brands easily try new packaging designs or <a href=\"https://shopnadco.com/collections/labels\" title=\"https://shopnadco.com/collections/labels\">custom labels</a> for targeted geographic areas. Without making a commitment to large minimum orders, brands can benefit from real-time marketing.</p>",
