        "text_L3DHGL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Digital printing can help efficiently increase consumer engagement, innovation, and brand reputation. This is because it creates customized labels and packaging that help products stand out and can easily be adjusted according to current marketing trends or personalization needs.</p><p>If you’re ready to enhance your brand with eye-catching graphics and labeling, digital printing can provide the high-quality images you need. NADCO’s experienced <a href=\"https://shopnadco.com/pages/custom-tape-solutions-for-engineers\" title=\"https://shopnadco.com/pages/custom-tape-solutions-for-engineers\">graphic design</a> team can help you design custom images or update your existing designs to create a unique display for your brand. Because we have extensive in-house capabilities, NADCO works with you <a href=\"https://shopnadco.com/pages/custom-tape-solutions-for-engineers\" title=\"https://shopnadco.com/pages/custom-tape-solutions-for-engineers\">every step of the way</a>, from start to finish, to produce the standard and custom labels and tapes you need.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/contact-us\" title=\"Contact us\">Contact us</a> or <a href=\"/pages/request-a-quote\" title=\"Request a Quote\">request a quote</a> for more information about our digital printing services.</p>",
